Subject: [PATCH 5/6] Android: stub libzmq/CoACD headers, package libmujoco.so

The dev bridge (ZMQ) and mesh decomposition (CoACD) have no Android build;
stub headers make their calls fail cleanly. URLab_UPL.xml copies
libmujoco.so into the APK next to libUnreal.so.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
